msgctxt "92"
msgid "Have you seen a girl with a sketchbook around here recently?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Yeah. I think I saw her walk by with her mother a little bit ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Her mother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I mean, I imagine it was her mother... The two of 'em were holding hands, "
"so I thought for sure they were mother and daughter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Where did you see them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Over in Hatsumachi. I remember because I was thinking it was a bit of a "
"strange place to bring a kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Hatsumachi, huh? All right, thanks."
msgstr ""

